'''''Ophthalmotilapia nasuta''''' is a species of [[cichlid]] [[endemism|endemic]] to [[Lake Tanganyika]].  It can reach a length of {{convert|20|cm|in}} [[fish measurement|TL]].  It can also be found in the [[aquarium]] trade.<ref>{{FishBase |genus= Ophthalmotilapia|species= nasuta| month = April | year = 2013}}</ref>

